{"version":1,"content":"<p>【很難看 ... 😆】以為靠著「二五仔」舉報的漏洞，就能一舉殲滅整個 PlayStation 5 破解社群，沒想到「三日兩 Patch」推送了 PS5 14.10、14.20 新韌體修補被發現的破解漏洞後，新韌體僅花 8 小時就被破解團隊再度攻破。</p><p>看來 Sony 很難在 GTA 6 推出之前，達成封鎖 PS5 破解社群的目標。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:42:09.756404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:35:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:43.985054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:37:49.469389+00:00","content_hash":"4454803a16135bed822137cdec749e3f1a4cd907df2d2e9c115d29980c7fe234","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}